-- BRONZE LAYER
T_1.Analyze source systems
  T_1.1 -> Business Context & Ownership
  T_1.2 -> Architecture & Technology Stack
  T_1.3 -> Extract & Load

 T_1.1 Business Context & Ownership
   1. Who owns the data ?
   2. What Business process it supports ?
   3. System & Data documentation
   4. Data Model & Data Catalog

 T_1.2 -> Architecture & Technology Stack
   1. How is data stored ? (SQL Server,Oracle,AWS,Azure,..)
   2. What are the Integration capabilities ? (API,Kafka,File Extract,Direct DB,..)

 T_1.3 -> Extract & Load
   1. Incremental vs Full Loads
   2. Data Scopr & Historical Needs
   3. What is the expected size of the extracts?
   4. Are there any data volume limitations?
   5. How to avoid impacting the source system's performance
   6. Authentication and Authorization (tokens,SSH keys,VPN,IP whitelisting,..)
